<title>JAPAN: Chichibu Onoda, Lafarge to form China venture.</title>
<headline>Chichibu Onoda, Lafarge to form China venture.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chichibu Onoda Cement Corp said on Monday that it and the Lafarge group of France would set up a company in Shanghai to make plasterboard.</p>
<p>The venture will be 57 percent owned by the Lafarge group, 38 percent owned by Chichibu Onoda and five percent by a Chinese partner, a Chichibu Onoda spokesman said.</p>
<p>The venture will start production in the middle of 1998 with a production target of 20 million sq metres of plaster board a year, he said.</p>
</text>
